# _African Drumming for the lil' ones...._

_African Drumming for little ones... if your child enjoys making noise, getting physical and creating sound on beautiful hand carved traditional instruments..then this could be the next perfect activity for your child. We are beginning NEW kids classes on the Sunshine Coast.  To register your interest email info@rhythmculture.com.au STAY TUNED!_
